1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,800
Hey, is anybody sitting here?

2
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:05,100
No, go ahead. Grab a seat.

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:07,400
Thanks. I'm totally beat.

4
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:09,700
Rough day at work?

5
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:12,000
You have no idea. My boss chewed me out again.

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,300
What for this time?

7
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,600
I showed up ten minutes late.

8
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,900
Ten minutes? Give me a break.

9
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:21,200
That's what I said!

10
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:23,500
Well, I wouldn't sweat it.

11
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,800
Easy for you to say. You work from home.

12
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:28,100
Fair enough.

13
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,400
So, are you still up for the movie tonight?

14
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:32,700
I don't know. I might bail.

15
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:35,000
Come on, you promised!

16
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:37,300
Okay, okay. I'll tag along.

17
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:39,600
Great. It starts at eight.

18
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:41,900
Let's grab a bite first.

19
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:44,200
Sounds like a plan.

20
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:46,500
I'm gonna get another coffee. You want one?

21
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,800
I'm good, thanks.

22
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:51,100
Suit yourself.

23
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:53,400
Wait, do you have change for a twenty?

24
00:00:53,900 --> 00:00:55,700
Hang on, let me check.

25
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:04,000
So how was the movie?

26
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:06,300
Honestly? It was kind of a letdown.

27
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:08,600
Really? Everyone's raving about it.

28
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:10,900
The ending made no sense.

29
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:13,200
Maybe you just didn't get it.

30
00:01:13,700 --> 00:01:15,500
Maybe. Or maybe it was just bad.

31
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,800
Did you at least have fun?

32
00:01:18,300 --> 00:01:20,100
Sure. The popcorn was worth it.

33
00:01:20,600 --> 00:01:22,400
You're impossible.

34
00:01:22,900 --> 00:01:24,700
I'll take that as a compliment.

35
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:27,000
It wasn't one.

36
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:29,300
Anyway, I've got to run.

37
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:31,600
See you around?

38
00:01:32,100 --> 00:01:33,900
Count on it.

39
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:36,200
Take care.

40
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:38,500
You too.

41
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:40,800
Don't forget your umbrella.

42
00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:43,100
It's supposed to pour later.

43
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:45,400
Thanks for the heads-up.

44
00:01:45,900 --> 00:01:47,700
Any time.

45
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:50,000
Bye now.
